    <Name>INT_2023_0128</Name>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2023_0128","fieldKey":"title"} -->
    <Title>Against the installation that was mistaken for scaffolding</Title>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2023_0128","fieldKey":"date"} -->
    <Date>2023-09-17</Date>
    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2023_0128","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Þóra Castellanos talks about silence, in three coats of varnish. The artist answered every question with a question, and then with a long pause, which the transcript renders as "…".</Description>
    <MDGroup>
